The undersigned is directed to say that with effect from the 9th January, 2004 :-

i) The Prime Minister relinquished the charge of the offices of Minister of Environment and Forests and Minister of Non-Conventional Energy Sources;

ii) Shri Kariya Munda relinquished the charge of the office of Minister of Coal and assumed the charge of the office of Minister of Non-conventional Energy Sources;

iii) Kum. Mamata Banerjee assumed the charge of the office of Minister of Coal and Mines;

iv) Shri Ramesh Bais relinquished the charge of the office of Minister of State (Independent charge) in the Ministry of Mines and assumed the charge of the office of Minister of State (Independent charge) in the Ministry of Environment and Forests; and

v) Dr. Vallabhbhai Ramjibhai Kathiria relinquished the charge of the office of Minister of State in the Ministry of Human Resource Development and assumed the charge of the office of Minister of State in the Ministry of Health and Family Welfare.
